WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.440
I used it to be a woman who loves too much, and I wouldn't wish that to anyone.

00:06.440 --> 00:14.080
I suffered so much when my relationship ended that I cried every single day for 6 months.

00:14.080 --> 00:20.560
In the very first week, the grief was so heavy that I ended up with pneumonia.

00:20.560 --> 00:23.800
I just wanted to die.

00:23.800 --> 00:31.280
My entire life was centered around him, all my plans, all my purpose, everything is painted

00:31.280 --> 00:34.360
around that relationship.

00:34.360 --> 00:39.500
And when he broke up with me, there was absolutely nothing left.

00:39.500 --> 00:44.840
To make things worse, my mother had just passed away.

00:44.840 --> 00:51.880
I felt as if the ground had opened up under my feet and a piece of my heart had been ripped

00:51.880 --> 00:52.880
out.

00:52.880 --> 00:56.540
It hurt physically.

00:56.540 --> 01:02.920
I thought I'd never be able to love anyone else, and at the same time, I was terrified

01:02.920 --> 01:06.800
at the mere thought of going through that again.

01:06.800 --> 01:14.640
I only started getting back on my feet about a year later, and once I recovered, I made

01:14.640 --> 01:22.720
a strict promise to myself that I would never, ever go through that again.

01:22.720 --> 01:27.280
From that day on, I put my head down and did the hard work.

01:27.280 --> 01:28.640
It wasn't easy.

01:28.640 --> 01:36.280
I forced myself to look at my own shadows, at my emotional games, at my deep neediness,

01:36.280 --> 01:40.060
and that's where I learned how to let go.

01:40.060 --> 01:43.160
I learned to set the other person free.

01:43.160 --> 01:50.320
I learned to set boundaries, to say no, to just be myself without trying to please the

01:50.320 --> 01:53.240
other every second of the day.

01:53.240 --> 01:59.640
Today I've been happily married for 12 years to the man of my life who loves me and respects

01:59.640 --> 02:04.960
me, and he's not just my partner, he's my best friend.

02:04.960 --> 02:12.600
I've spent 18 years helping women break out of this exactly cycle of suffering and emotional

02:12.600 --> 02:14.200
dependence.

02:14.200 --> 02:18.800
